{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "a81a95fac1d0e90f10496c2b04feb6d9a78f7b17c57a34d33d146e8e3e8af691", "ja": "天使たちの笑顔", "zh": "天使们的笑容", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "98874b4c7c5212b9ce8822c47dd439f322fc8c7f75600a153c92bef4d363dd05", "ja": "公演が大成功を収めたご褒美に、全員で温泉\n旅館にやってきたメンバー達。めいめいに羽\nを伸ばしているところに、プロデューサーは\n写真撮影を提案。写真に写る天使たちの笑顔\nは、晴れやかなものだった。", "zh": "为奖励公演圆满落幕，所有成员们一起来到了\n温泉旅馆。在大家各自放松身心时，制作人\n提议一起合照。照片中的天使们，都挂着开朗\n灿烂的笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4713d9fcf630fecc9e509883c88341be6f5afa60fc1f8593bb29cd98657cc4a1", "ja": "（Angelの公演は、大成功に終わった。\n今日は社長のはからいで、みんなでご褒美旅行だ）", "zh": "（Angel的公演以大成功落幕。\n今天的庆功旅行由社长出资，好好奖励大家。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "660859bbe93362211287fafed25a6976f915834f97cf16d370f8efd3d3508590", "ja": "わぁ……ステキなお部屋ですね！\n畳のいい匂いがします！", "zh": "哇……好棒的房间喔！\n榻榻米的味道好好闻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "0afef35edf221b5e9bfa3af62a5ef174cda2137d2a21a0bd2d0b4604b70523e8", "ja": "窓から見える庭園にも、趣があって……。\nみんなも、早く来られるといいですね！", "zh": "窗外的庭园景色也别有风味……\n要是大家都能早点来就好了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ea370a0af03ab91b8f2f3f0d4792d4bf42e9a6031fdc4f7f36f5c0d0e650a5a3", "ja": "他のメンバーは、仕事が終わり次第の合流ですから。\nでも、夕食には間に合う予定です。", "zh": "其他成员会在工作结束后过来集合，\n不过应该都赶得上晚餐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "49315a85a81c8f7129987a3f02496dab65a545e970d6803648aaaa2ba5b98276", "ja": "う～ん、どうせだったら高級ホテルがよかったな～。\nもっと大人なカンジの……。", "zh": "唔～既然都来了，要是住高级饭店就好了呢～\n感觉会更成熟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3b4e11d3db5dccb24f20a8f7a312f18e013c4fcfd9a330ad9dd5a2f808946db7", "ja": "旅館って、なんか家族旅行っぽくないですか～？", "zh": "住旅馆不就像家庭旅行一样吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9755972e97f40a82f4ec13468bc77cc52fc4d749a3196b98da23eb7d4faca085", "ja": "いいじゃないか、家族旅行で。\nたまにはのんびりするのも、いいものだぞ。", "zh": "家庭旅行不也很好吗？\n偶尔悠闲地度过也很不错喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "000732dab80d3c936d6973e9805830bd9c655291a0d245c62f44b6062b965afa", "ja": "翼さん！　この旅館、いろいろなお風呂があるみたい\nですよ？　パンフレットに書いてあります。", "zh": "翼姊姊！这家旅馆好像有各式各样的温泉喔！\n介绍手册上面有写。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f8403440c25fb4c2e3d81705ab4940d9d321090ea37c064207df706c0c9b7c23", "ja": "いろいろな温泉……わっ、美白の湯だって！\nえへへ、ちょっと見てきま～す！", "zh": "各式各样的温泉……哇，有美白温泉！\n嘿嘿，我去看一下～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "7b17bd3e2116261501fee31cd9a6f2cbc05c749e4d5e0b44315d5e5369a0537c", "ja": "あ、わたしも一緒に行きます！\n広いお風呂、気持ちよさそうです♪", "zh": "啊，我也一起去！\n宽敞的温泉感觉很舒服呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1a5487ea01f2abad83187d3d26e7ebf5eebe3a6dd2d89d399c58b6cb02b495e0", "ja": "着いたばっかりなのに、元気だな……\nふたりとも、気を付けて行くんだぞ。", "zh": "明明才刚到，还真有活力……\n你们要注意安全喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "6d81d4445625daa700962274faee32d5b17022cde3b261d7e68785396e095717", "ja": "装備……属性、どれがいいかな……\nちゃんと……合わせないと……。", "zh": "装备……属性，要选哪个好呢……\n要好好……搭配才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "901a2d6b5299dd9b609081114b4a9a82402d47443e9e90f1973af12d13345d02", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん♪　何してるの？", "zh": "小杏奈♪你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "3b2b16b8766a3e08ad269e43f8a9959c4d5e5db20e43c0e4616a605a0f77b971", "ja": "ん……今から、エリアボスと……戦うから……\n装備、選んでるの……。", "zh": "嗯……接下来要跟区域BOSS……战斗……\n正在选装备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "b75e7eb335dd1da9f68597414f1872498c4c84cd89418482f9dbac66e74c6eed", "ja": "ふむふむ、色々な種類があるんだ……\nあ、ピッケルだ♪　じゃあ、登山靴はないの？", "zh": "嗯嗯，有这么多种类啊……\n啊，是冰镐♪那有没有登山鞋呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "da8f345d52b818d56b6d342c5aa76fec2da89b0064a1924b7f059cfb58671ab6", "ja": "スーパー登山靴！\nどんな山でも、バビューンって登れちゃうの♪", "zh": "例如超级登山鞋！\n不管是什么山，都能一溜烟地爬上去♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "1f45c0e2f826950b402ca8fc0684b3607f6e3c6255fae972e9f8dfd51aa5a124", "ja": "移動速度……上がる装備なら……\nある、けど……。", "zh": "是有……提升移动速度……\n的装备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "7e005ad44fc4fd1a0bca8603925692b7024299afeb5b03d5ffae4fec2275cf46", "ja": "そうなの？　見せて見せて！", "zh": "是吗？借我看借我看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "e349dfe2715d3824fc9bdf96c4cfb73e30c479038ec590283e2669ca7b4ba775", "ja": "ん……♪", "zh": "嗯……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "d1655bb4769534842e37a3a11f8c3885dbdf31e87295a9ea938b3e86145191a3", "ja": "{$P$}さん。荷物運び、\nありがとうございました。お茶はいかがですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n谢谢你帮忙搬行李，要不要喝点茶呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "0ecf4759a4a01ac7193bd9f491d4c0473929db48900aac137aabdd34bb474cf5", "ja": "あっ、すみません。\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "啊，麻烦你了。\n谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "cc498b5b5a4c65e686fbdec7006ddac3c6bad9a48673f45e0893f0cf74f2280a", "ja": "あらためて、Angelチームのお披露目公演、\nお疲れさまでした。", "zh": "藉这个机会，我要再跟你说一次，\nAngel队的首次亮相公演，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "5c676ec9bd404e365fe1640a31c0b8a2eac394942154826d920f85a9a1cc7fac", "ja": "{$P$}さんのおかげで、\n本当に、素敵な公演になったと思います♪", "zh": "多亏{$P$}先生，\n真的是场很棒的公演♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d1f45e4623aabef118899e5cb67fbfae18f6ebc4f182607daf02def74f6dc4e9", "ja": "俺は、ほんの少し背中を押しただけですよ。\n成功したのは、みんな自身の力です。", "zh": "我只是在大家背后轻轻推了一把而已。\n能够成功，靠的是大家自己的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "58751b833a1ff137812e15d0dfa4e68eea84a80c54f1bbafcf17f99ff5c3a77d", "ja": "ふふっ。そんな貴方の支えがあるから、私は……。\nみんな、ステージに飛び出していけるんです♪", "zh": "呵呵，因为有你的支持，我才能……\n大家才能登上舞台♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a22a9e75d1b45a7fbb461903c5ab538b18e651ee13a5d971d785c7688c13b8c0", "ja": "歌織さん……。", "zh": "歌织小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "071095a0e8f5a827e5df110e733f01868578183288ebb5b027310a0d483acc59", "ja": "歌織さん、麗花さん、杏奈ちゃん！\nお風呂、すごく楽しそうでしたよ！", "zh": "歌织姊姊、丽花姊姊、小杏！\n温泉看起来很好玩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "ffc292645254306afc0690df818add2724aac90b116d53fb15f1472771868387", "ja": "よかったら、一緒に入りに行きませんか？", "zh": "有空的话，要不要一起去泡呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0ea7876d7a5f8c3730cd489542e5f9cc7285dd9995d6e3158284c4952736bcd3", "ja": "美白の湯も、サウナもありますよ～！\nみんなでモテモテになりましょうよ～♪", "zh": "有美白温泉和三温暖喔～！\n大家一起加强桃花运吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "aa92b97621b733d21294744398a70b7ce6dac8c8b599223f4087ac3a597f4477", "ja": "まぁ、楽しそう！\nそうね、みんなで行きましょうか。", "zh": "哇，听起来真不错！\n也是，大家一起去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "a46b9f09720e9e67ce58ec4a4c5b0ed69d60776d7993657c2cae1a5885070e19", "ja": "ねえねえ、その前に、タマゴ買いに行かない？\nみんなで温泉タマゴ作ろう♪", "zh": "话说我们要不要先去买鸡蛋？\n大家一起煮温泉蛋吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "2c68475f2444dc6f29974423937467242a7361522d0f8aa610c96e0280cd18fb", "ja": "温泉タマゴ……杏奈も、食べたい……。", "zh": "温泉蛋……杏奈也想吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "94d37669e3d403d17fdb3be8ef2a52cdb5d8884356ff276bbb542278c3940264", "ja": "いや、温泉タマゴってそんなすぐには作れない……\nまぁいいか。", "zh": "不，温泉蛋没办法那么快就煮好……\n算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1035_p", "source_sha256": "c5e16686107c707596440e95f2318a68009765fcab0874b05737deaceb9de6da", "ja": "おっと、そうだ。温泉に入りに行く前に、\n写真を撮っておかないとな。", "zh": "哦，对了，去泡温泉之前\n要先拍张照片才行啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a38e19d021acffef9e04795ae10f85fdebcf322467f8282440dbec41596145df", "ja": "は～い♪　{$P$}さん、\nちゃんとカワイく撮ってくださいね～？", "zh": "好～♪{$P$}先生，\n要拍得可爱点喔～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1037_p", "source_sha256": "8f3a6e727b79cbd3be0e0684a7163fdaeb5c2c920605f1e90e5ce845594d762d", "ja": "はは、任せろ。\nそれじゃあ、みんな並んでくれ！", "zh": "哈哈，包在我身上。\n那大家排好来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1038_052kao", "source_sha256": "00e66259620b30c8e629540b0f5950c742c07b5cf679b2c5bd4831cec494e581", "ja": "何か掛け声があった方が、ポーズがそろうかも\nしれませんね。どうしましょうか？", "zh": "如果有口号的话，大家的动作应该会比较整齐吧。\n该喊什么才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
