{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "6864c2941db9f0f5d613891c4da2363b7a499941f410ffcb06f424c74f99df1b", "ja": "わかりやすくて、いいと思います！", "zh": "简单易懂，我觉得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_07_1041_p", "source_sha256": "c512ed9dec49b8fddfde3e38f88adf130e34c165ddb87daea684f890e2c6bc43", "ja": "じゃあ、それで頼む。\nみんないくぞ……せーの！", "zh": "那就用那个吧，\n那大家注意，我要拍啰……预备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
